.TH CHM-BINARY-SCAN 1
.SH NAME
chm-binary-scan \- recursively inspect executable headers and hashes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python3 tools/binary/scan-binaries.py
.RI [ ROOT ] [ --json FILE ] [ --max-size BYTES ] [ --include-vendor ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Identifies ELF, PE/COFF, DOS MZ, Mach-O, Java class and WebAssembly files recursively. Computes SHA-256 hashes and never executes discovered files.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --json FILE
Write the machine-readable report.
.TP
.B --max-size BYTES
Skip files larger than the limit. Default: 536870912.
.TP
.B --include-vendor
Include vendored trees.
.SH SAFETY
Header recognition is not a trust decision. Verify provenance and signatures before execution.
